[statement]
As `a-dependency-with-one-candidate-is-installed-at-once`, with `lo2`
providing `Y` too: `X` is decided first, for `hi`, and `Y` goes to `lo2`,
listed before `lo`.

[repository]
P:top
V:1
D:z base

P:base
V:1

P:z
V:1
D:X

P:e
V:1
i:base
D:Y

P:lo2
V:1
p:Y=1

P:hi
V:1
k:100
p:X

P:lo
V:1
p:X Y=1

[request]
top

[answer apk-tools 3.0.9-r0]
install hi 1
install z 1
install base 1
install lo2 1
install e 1
install top 1
